IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa17-helpers`

-- coa17-part21-ch2.l4: Companies Act 2006 (United Kingdom), Part 21, Chapter 2 -- Evidencing and transfer of title to
-- securities without written instrument (ss 783 to 790; lines 10106-10176 of ukpga-2006-46.txt). LAYER 1: the law,
-- objectively. SOURCE and TARGET are as in coa17-part21-ch1.l4 (a plain-text rendering, not the official text; the
-- stable `l4` 1.6.110). HOW TO READ AN ANSWER is as there: JUST TRUE the text says yes; JUST FALSE the text says no in its
-- own words (every such branch carries a FALSE-kind comment); NOTHING the text does not decide (every such branch
-- carries a NOTHING-kind comment); a caller never turns NOTHING into FALSE.
--
-- WHAT IS NOT ENCODED HERE. Sections 784 to 789 are the Treasury's and the Secretary of State's powers to make regulations
-- and orders under this Chapter, with their procedure and the duty to consult: machinery (inert, reason 2 in NOTES.md).
-- Until regulations are made they decide nothing for a person. Section 783 is encoded for what it defines and
-- section 790 for what it sends to Chapter 3 of Part 3.

§ `Part 21 Chapter 2: Evidencing and transfer of title to securities without written instrument`

§§ `Introductory (s 783)`

-- src:10109 | In this Chapter—
-- src:10110 | (a) “securities” means shares, debentures, debenture stock, loan stock, bonds, units of a collective investment scheme within the meaning of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (c. 8) and other securities of any description;
@ref s 783(a) "securities" (src:10109-10110)
DECLARE `s 783(a) kind of instrument` IS ONE OF
    `s 783(a) shares`
    `s 783(a) debentures`
    `s 783(a) debenture stock`
    `s 783(a) loan stock`
    `s 783(a) bonds`
    `s 783(a) units of a collective investment scheme within the meaning of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000`
    `s 783(a) an instrument of some other kind`

GIVEN `the kind of instrument` IS A `s 783(a) kind of instrument`
      `the instrument is a security of some other description` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 783(a) the instrument is a security for the purposes of this Chapter` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of instrument`
    WHEN `s 783(a) an instrument of some other kind` THEN
        IF `the instrument is a security of some other description`
        THEN JUST TRUE -- "and other securities of any description"
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“securities” means shares, debentures, debenture stock, loan stock, bonds, units of a collective investment scheme ... and other securities of any description"
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:10111 | (b) references to title to securities include any legal or equitable interest in securities;
@ref s 783(b) references to title to securities include any legal or equitable interest (src:10111)
GIVEN `it is a legal interest in securities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is an equitable interest in securities` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 783(b) the interest counts as title to securities` MEANS
    IF `it is a legal interest in securities` OR `it is an equitable interest in securities`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "references to title to securities include any legal or equitable interest in securities"

-- src:10112 | (c) references to a transfer of title include a transfer by way of security;
@ref s 783(c) references to a transfer of title include a transfer by way of security (src:10112)
GIVEN `it is a transfer by way of security` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 783(c) the transfer counts as a transfer of title` MEANS
    IF `it is a transfer by way of security`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "references to a transfer of title include a transfer by way of security"

-- src:10113 | (d) references to transfer without a written instrument include, in relation to bearer securities, transfer without delivery.
@ref s 783(d) references to transfer without a written instrument include, in relation to bearer securities, transfer without delivery (src:10113)
GIVEN `the securities are bearer securities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the transfer is without delivery` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 783(d) the transfer counts as a transfer without a written instrument` MEANS
    IF `the securities are bearer securities` AND `the transfer is without delivery`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "references to transfer without a written instrument include, in relation to bearer securities, transfer without delivery"

§§ `Supplementary (s 790)`

-- src:10176 | Chapter 3 of Part 3 (resolutions affecting a company's constitution) applies to a resolution passed by virtue of regulations under this Chapter.
@ref s 790 Resolutions to be forwarded to registrar (src:10176)
GIVEN `the resolution was passed by virtue of regulations under this Chapter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790 Chapter 3 of Part 3 applies to the resolution` MEANS
    IF `the resolution was passed by virtue of regulations under this Chapter`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "applies to a resolution passed by virtue of regulations under this Chapter"
